  "mode": "",
  "notes": "The Turtle knowledge base's Fury list: Bloodthirst and Whirlwind on cooldown, Execute below 20%, Slam only standing still with Flurry up, the on-next-swing Heroic Strike above 70 rage (not in the Execute phase), the dual-wield fillers (Master Strike, Hamstring, Sunder), Battle Shout, and the AoE rows (Sweeping Strikes, Whirlwind, Cleave, Bloodthirst/Slam, Execute). Its cooldowns: Death Wish and Recklessness in the Execute phase, Bloodrage into Execute. Berserker Rage's roots and slows, the Lawnmower build and a few item and opener rows are named in kb.unexpressed.",
  "rows": [
    {
      "from": "rotation_single",
      "index": 0,
      "priority": 0,
      "text": "Charge -> Sunder Armor -> Bloodrage (Enrage) | opener; DW: Bloodrage just before Bloodthirst so two BTs fit in Enrage",
      "text_sha": "9c9d61072316",
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "charge",
          "spell": "Charge",
          "level": 4,
          "target": "fight",
          "band": "move",
